'''Scientist's Beam''' is a [[debuff]] that appears in Research encounters and Research safehouses of the [[Immortal Syndicate]]. It uses the same status icon as [[Degeneration Aura]] (lightning damage variant), [[Piety Beam]] and [[Lightning Beam]].

As "LightningSearingBond", the internal file name of the status icon suggested, it is a monster version {{il|Searing Bond}} that deals lightning damage between the two totems. The totems are not targetable, however.

